                "text": "I toured @NYULangone\u2019s Sunset Park Family Health Center with hospital leadership and discussed the crushing impact of the Big Ugly Bill on our health care system. \n\u00a0\nAs the GOP moves to strip over 1.5m New Yorkers of their health insurance, I will continue to fight to make health care accessible and affordable for all.",
