                "retweet_count": 9,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I visited Cadman @forFamilyHealth Center in Brooklyn Heights to discuss how Trump\u2019s Medicaid cuts will harm Federally Qualified Health Centers that provide essential primary care to many of the most vulnerable among us. \n\u00a0\nCadman provides 90,000 visits to 35,000 patients per year, and often provides the only medical care those patients receive. \n\nThe Big Ugly Bill\u2019s health care cuts will devastate the vital services they provide.",
