                "retweet_count": 25,
                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Today marks 60 years since President Johnson signed Medicare and Medicaid into law\u2014lifelines that have helped hundreds of millions of Americans access the health care they need.\n\nNow, with the help of 7 NY Republicans, Trump\u2019s budget will strip coverage from 1.5m in NY alone.\n\nThey cut your health care to give tax breaks to billionaires.",
