                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "I hosted a roundtable with disability leaders and advocates for Disability Pride Month to discuss how the GOP\u2019s cuts to Medicaid and other programs will impact the disability community.\n\n1 in 4 Americans identify as having a disability, and we must ensure equal access and opportunity for all.\n\nI will continue to work with community partners to ensure the necessary services are available.",
