                "text": "So grateful to sit down with veterans and advocates in NY-10 for an honest conversation about the challenges they face.\n\nI will keep standing up against the administration\u2019s attacks on VA care, Medicaid, and other essential benefits our veterans have earned. https://t.co/eG5KfUOUTi",
