                "source": "Twitter Web App",
                "text": "Over the past seven months, Trump and the GOP have cut food aid, slashed Medicaid, implemented debilitating tariff taxes on small businesses, and militarized ICE enforcement\u2014all deeply harming New York's AAPI community.\n\nToday, I convened a roundtable of AAPI leaders and officials in Sunset Park to discuss how we are fighting back and how we can work together to make their voices heard.",
