                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "I reintroduced my bipartisan Michelle Go Act to expand access to psychiatric care by allowing Medicaid to cover more long-term beds for acute mental health care. \u00a0\n\nThis bipartisan bill honors Michelle\u2019s memory and ensures those in crisis get treatment \u2014 not cycled through hospitals, jails, and the streets.",
