                "retweet_count": 13,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Today I joined local health care providers for a roundtable during Health Care Costs Week of Action.\u00a0\n\nWhile Trump and Republicans pull health insurance for millions of Americans and costs skyrocket for everyone else, we must not only hold the line against these cuts but make plans to ensure all Americans get the quality care they deserve.\n\nIn the wealthiest country in the world, health care is a right not a privilege.",
