                "reply_count": 672,
                "retweet_count": 463,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Gleefully threatening mass firings in an effort to ram through a partisan Republican bill that cuts health care.\n\nPushing a shutdown isn\u2019t governing. It\u2019s economic sabotage. Trump is trying to extort the American people by pitting their jobs against their healthcare. \u00a0\n\nDemocrats are working to keep the government open and protect families from his cruel cuts.",
