                "retweet_count": 120,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Trump and his congressional Republicans are shutting the government down to continue to gut healthcare and slash funding to states that did not vote for Trump. This is an escalation of what they have been doing for nine months and is yet another example of why Democrats must hold the line to prevent this kind of unlawful conduct from happening in the future.",
