                "text": "Republicans call this a \u201cclean CR.\u201d In NY-10, \u201cclean\u201d means: 8,000 facing massive premium hikes and over 40,000 losing healthcare coverage entirely.\u00a0\n\u00a0\nThere\u2019s nothing \u201cclean\u201d about cruelty. https://t.co/jcramQz871",
