                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "After voting to kick 15 million Americans off of their health insurance in Trump\u2019s Big Ugly Bill, Republicans have now shut down the government because they refuse to extend lifesaving ACA tax credits that over 22 million Americans rely on.\u00a0\u00a0\n\nIf they don\u2019t act, millions of families will see their premiums more than double.\u00a0\n\nTrump must stop putting billionaires over babies and extend the tax cuts.",
