                "text": "This shutdown isn\u2019t abstract. It\u2019s 54,000 federal civilian employees across New York \u2014 and nearly 2 million nationwide \u2014 locked out of their jobs and paychecks. It\u2019s 37,091 people in NY-10 losing Medicaid, and thousands more on Obamacare.\u00a0\n\nRepublicans\u2019 war on healthcare is devastating real people.",
